WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:03,090
This woman is so thick-skinned

2
00:00:03,090 --> 00:00:04,570
Joined the room less than two hours ago

3
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:06,490
When eating and drinking, you don’t treat yourself like an outsider.

4
00:00:06,490 --> 00:00:07,890
But I still can't talk to her

5
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:09,730
Her venomous face and shameless character

6
00:00:09,730 --> 00:00:11,210
Simply my nemesis

7
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:13,530
I'll sleep first

8
00:00:13,530 --> 00:00:20,600
I may have to go out tomorrow. Come and wash the dishes.

9
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,200
You have nothing to do anyway

10
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:24,360
Help me wash it first

11
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:41,220
What a devil
